# botmsg dependencies.
# imsg is the only one: a standalone MIT CLI (openclaw/imsg) that sends and
# reads iMessage/SMS from the terminal. It is what makes this tool harness
# agnostic — any process can shell out to it, with no dependency on Claude
# Code, OpenClaw or any other agent runtime.
